    "https://careers.singaporetech.edu.sg/job/Senior-Executive%2C-Marketing-%28Operations%29%2C-SITLEARN-%2811-months-contract%29/1087-en_GB": {
      "title": "Senior Executive, Marketing (Operations), SITLEARN (11-months contract) Job Details",
      "description": "Senior Executive, Marketing (Operations), SITLEARN (11-months contract) Job Details | Singapore Institute of Technology Senior Executive, Marketing (Operations), SITLEARN (11-months contract) We use cookies to offer you the best possible website experience. Your cookie preferences will be stored in your browser’s local storage. This includes cookies necessary for the website's operation. Additionally, you can freely decide and change any time whether you accept cookies or choose to opt out of cookies to improve the website's performance, as well as cookies used to display content tailored to your interests. Your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer may be impacted if you do not accept all cookies. Modify Cookie Preferences Reject All Cookies Accept All Cookies Skip to main content Home View All Jobs Sign In / View Profile Home View All Jobs Sign In / View Profile Home View All Jobs Sign In / View Profile Search Jobs Job Description Apply Now Senior Executive, Marketing (Operations), SITLEARN (11-months contract) Posting Start Date: 06/08/2026 Schemes of Service: Corporate Division: SITLEARN Employment Type: Temporary Location: SIT Punggol Campus Work Arrangement: Hybrid (On-campus and remote) Reports to: Assistant Director, Marketing About SIT LEARN SIT LEARN is the lifelong learning arm of the Singapore Institute of Technology (SIT). Our mission is to empower adult learners with industry-relevant skills and knowledge to thrive in a rapidly evolving world. We offer a diverse portfolio of upskilling programmes designed to support career transitions, deepen professional expertise, and foster continuous growth. The Role We are looking for an organised, dependable marketing operations specialist to keep SIT LEARN 's marketing engine running smoothly across all portfolios. You'll be the backbone that keeps budgets, timelines, collaterals, and logistics on track, so the rest of the team can focus on great campaigns, content and results. Key Responsibilities Manage marketing budget tracking and reporting across all portfolios and campaigns. Coordinate project and process operations timelines and task management, and cross-team workflows to keep tasks and projects on schedule. Create course content (e.g. programme description, learning outcomes, trainers profiles) based on course proposals, working closely with programme owners and faculty to validate accuracy and alignment Ensure consistency of language, tone, and format across course content and collateral, maintaining a coherent standard across all portfolios Manage website update requests and coordinate with relevant teams for timely execution. Oversee physical collateral inventory — production, storage, and distribution — across events and campaigns. Coordinate logistics for events and booth sponsorships, including vendor liaison and on-site arrangements. Support data collation and reporting needs across the team. Manage relationships with external vendors and agencies for production and logistics needs. Qualifications & Skills 3+ years of experience in marketing operations, project coordination, or related field. Strong organisational and project management skills, with an ability to juggle multiple concurrent timelines. Strong content writing and editing skills, whether hands-on or AI-assisted. Comfortable liaising with multiple stakeholders for information gathering and output alignment. Comfortable with budget tracking, reporting tools, and vendor coordination. Detail-oriented, process-driven, and dependable under tight timelines. Highly adaptable, comfortable navigating ambiguity and a fast-changing programme landscape. A genuine passion for lifelong learning and making a mission-driven impact. Why Join Us? At SIT LEARN , you'll be part of a purpose-driven team that's shaping the future of adult learning in Singapore. We're growing fast, our programme landscape is evolving, and we thrive on ambiguity and change — if you're energised by building in a fast-paced environment and want work that genuinely matters, you'll feel at home here. Apply Now Job Alerts Link Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Copyright © 2025 Singapore Institute of Technology. All Rights Reserved. × Cookie Consent Manager When you visit any website, it may store or retrieve information on your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow some types of cookies. However, blocking some types of cookies may impact your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer. Required Cookies These cookies are required to use this website and can't be turned off. Required Cookies Show More Details Required Cookies Provider Description Enabled SAP as service provider We use the following session cookies, which are all required to enable the website to function: \"route\" is used for session stickiness \"careerSiteCompanyId\" is used to send the request to the correct data centre \"JSESSIONID\" is placed on the visitor's device during the session so the server can identify the visitor \"Load balancer cookie\" (actual cookie name may vary) prevents a visitor from bouncing from one instance to another Cookies from provider SAPasserviceprovider are required and cannot be turned off Functional Cookies These cookies provide a better customer experience on this site, such as by remembering your login details, optimising video performance or providing us with information about how our site is used. You may freely choose to accept or decline these cookies at any time. Note that certain functionalities that these third-parties make available may be impacted if you do not accept these cookies. Consent to all Functional Cookies Show More Details Functional Cookies Provider Description Enabled Vimeo Vimeo is a video hosting, sharing and services platform focused on the delivery of video. Opting out of Vimeo cookies will disable